        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You open a seam in space and push someone through it.</p><p>The target must attempt a Will save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is banished to an empty pocket dimension for 1 minute, then returns to the space it left (or the nearest unoccupied space).</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but for 10 minutes.</p><hr /><p><strong>GM note:</strong> this Technique's rank is deliberately 5, so a Gemini Saint gains it at 9th level. Before then, a Gemini Saint's signature is @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Genro Mao Ken (Shadow)], which the Two Faces passive grants in either aspect.</p>"
